<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305240> schema:description "Photogrammetric 3D scan (KIRI Engine) of a white stepped LEGO pyramid (nine levels) with a five-brick column and a minifigure-style warrior figure on top (spiked helmet, mail shirt, tunic, cloak), a hobby build by Florian Thiery; scanned on 2026-11-12 in the Apothekertrakt of Schönbrunn Palace, Vienna, where the model was on display during the CHNT31 conference. Raw scan without clean-up. The paired reconstruction is a separate FDOx and derives from this one." .
